    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="336c0fea-5f05-5145-a2a2-ebd95d859e7d" activityNameId="68411ade-4f98-57e8-bb75-672f79cc8a4c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 10MW, offshore, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 10MW, offshore, moving parts
UUID=a298d58c-74c6-3f22-a483-78533cf7f9a9
Wind turbine moving parts (without tower and substructure), at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the plant IEA reference 10MW offshore wind turbine.
The distance to installation port is assumed to be 80 km.
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.

Main data source: 
Kainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601

Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a298d58c-74c6-3f22-a483-78533cf7f9a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
